<title>FINLAND: ALCOM SEES FULL-YEAR 1996 LOSS.</title>
<headline>ALCOM SEES FULL-YEAR 1996 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data systems maker Alcom Oy said in a statement on Thursday it expected its full-year 1996 result to show a loss.</p>
<p>&quot;The Alcom group's full-year 1996 result is expected to be in the red,&quot; Alcom said.</p>
<p>Alcom's January-June loss after financial items deepened to 2.8 million markka from a 1.7 million markka loss in the first half of 1995.</p>
<p>Alcom's full-year 1995 result was a 3.0 million markka loss.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
</text>
